==Battleground==
*20 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

